{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方第一块超大号、高亮白色文字，先看到“明知道回去未必找得回那份亲近，他却还是忍不住想：万一能呢？”。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他明知回去未必能找回曾经的亲近，却仍然动了回去试试的念头。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"不舍、放不下、抱有期待，带着一点侥幸。\",\n  \"missed\": \"他并不想因为这点期待就立刻回去忍让，而是想先把眼下生活过稳；即使仍害怕以后独自承担、心里没底，也不想因此撤回已经作出的打算。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"上下两块大号高亮文字都很显眼，第二块同样占据较大面积，会分走主视线。\",\n    \"下方大段文字包含现实安排、未来担忧和不愿退缩几个层次，需要进一步阅读才能理清。\",\n    \"右上角阶段目录是独立的小字信息，虽然不抢主视线，但扫读时仍存在额外信息。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "3e4ffa4c-0021-49e0-b071-49f589a33c90", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T013700972568Z", "elapsed_seconds": 24.672, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:37:25.658744+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "73f1018c84c835b4345da6d4f4ce84c43d530167b2fedb20ddc02c506318d2eb", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683"